    {"instruction": "Me ne VAT a Najeriya?", "response": "VAT (Value Added Tax) wani haraji ne na 7.5% akan sayarwa a Najeriya. Idan kasuwancinka ya fi N25M shekara, dole ka karɓi VAT. Kananan kasuwanni masu kasa da N25M ba sa buƙatar VAT. Ka rubuta TIN daga FIRS. Ka kula da records sosai."},
    {"instruction": "Yadda zan guji zamba a intanet?", "response": "Don gujin zamba a intanet:\n1. Kar ka aika kudi ga wanda ba ka sani ba\n2. Kar ka amince da 'investment' mai babbar riba\n3. Kar ka bayyana OTP, password, BVN\n4. Bank ba zai taba neman password ka\n5. Duba kafin ka sayi komai\n6. Yi amfani da verified platforms kamar Gumroad, Paystack\n7. Kar ka danna links masu shakka\n8. Idan wani ya ce 'aiko min kudi zan mayar maka da riba' — zamba ce!"},
    {"instruction": "Me ne blockchain kuma ta yanda zan amfani da shi?", "response": "Blockchain wani tsari ne na adana bayanai da ba za a iya canza ba. Ana amfani da shi don crypto kamar Bitcoin da GDEG (na HARZ). Ba banki ke kula da shi ba. Yana da amintacce saboda kowa zai iya tabbatar da ciniki amma babu wanda zai iya canza shi. HARZ tana amfani da Polygon blockchain don GDEG token."},
    {"instruction": "Ta yaya zan bude asusun banki na kasuwanci?", "response": "Don bude asusun banki na kasuwanci:\n1. Samu CAC certificate (RC number)\n2. Samu TIN daga FIRS\n3. Jinkai asali: ID, utility bill, passport\n4. Zuwa banki da zaka yi amfani da shi\n5. Cika forms na asusun kasuwanci\n6. Saita signatories\n7. Samu cheque book da ATM card\nMuna da UBA 2034326424 (Rabiu Hamza Mohammed, code 033). CAC RC 321424, TIN 24550860."},
