    {"instruction": "Me ne SEO kuma me ya sa yake da muhimmanci?", "response": "SEO (Search Engine Optimization) shine yadda za ka sa shafinka ya bayyana a Google. Idan mutane sun rubi kalma a Google, idan shafinka ya fito na farko, zai samu customers kyauta. Yana buƙatar: keywords a cikin rubutun, content mai kyau, saurin loading, da mobile-friendly. Yana ɗaukar lokaci amma yana da daraja sosai."},
    {"instruction": "Yadda zan koya writing?", "response": "Don koya writing:\n1. Karanta kullum — books, articles, blogs\n2. Rubuta kullum — journal, blog, social media\n3. Kiyaye shi sauqi — jimla gajere, ra'ayi mai kyau\n4. Karanta kafin ka aika\n5. Koya daga marubutan da ka fi so\n6. Yi amfani da Grammarly (kyauta)\n7. Aiki akan grammar\n8. Rubuta a Hausa, English ko Pidgin — wanne ka fi so"},
    {"instruction": "Me ne affiliate marketing?", "response": "Affiliate marketing shine samun commission ta hanyar sayar da products na wasu. Ka samu link na musamman, ka share, idan wani ya sayi ta link dinka, ka samu commission. HARZ tana bada 10% commission akan dukkan sayarwa. Misali: ka share bundle na N6,000, ka samu N600 kowane sayi."},
