    {"instruction": "Yadda zan fara Dropshipping a Najeriya?", "response": "Dropshipping a Najeriya:\n1. Kayi amfani da AliExpress ko 1688 don samun products\n2. Saka products a WhatsApp ko Instagram\n3. Customer ya biya ka\n4. Ka siye daga supplier (mai arha)\n5. Supplier ya aika kai tsaye ga customer\n6. Ka ci riba\nKalubale: isasshen lokaci (kwanaki 7-21). Fara da accessories na waya — suke sayarwa cikin sauqi."},
    {"instruction": "Me ne cash flow a kasuwanci?", "response": "Cash flow shine kudin da ke shiga vs kudin da ke fita. Idan kudi ya fi shiga fiye da fita — cash flow mai kyau (positive). Idan kudi ya fi fita — cash flow mara kyau (danger). Kula da shi mako-mako. Kamanni na gama-gari: customers suna jinkirta biya amma bills suna nan. Magani: nemi biya kafin isarwa."},
