    {"instruction": "Write a press release for HARZ", "response": "FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE\n\nHARZ Digital Services Launches Complete AI-Powered Digital Ecosystem for Nigeria\n\nJalingo, Taraba State — HARZ Digital Services (CAC RC 321424) announces the launch of its 63+ platform digital ecosystem, featuring 300+ digital products, AI-powered customer support, and comprehensive digital learning resources for Nigerian entrepreneurs and students.\n\nThe HARZ Digital Learning Series, authored by founder Rabiu Hamza Mohammed, includes 12 practical computer skills books covering everything from Excel to Python programming, available for N2,500 each or N6,000 for the complete bundle.\n\nThe ecosystem also includes HarzDM Marketplace, Abuja Estate City, EduWealth AI, OMEGA Health AI, HarzMusic, HarzFilm, and HarzPay — all powered by 7 AI agents providing 24/7 customer support, marketing, and financial tracking.\n\nProducts are available at https://hamzarabiu.gumroad.com with instant delivery.\n\nContact: hamzarabiu390@gmail.com | 08028687857"},
