    {"instruction": "How do I write a value proposition?", "response": "Writing a value proposition:\n\nFormula: I help [target] achieve [result] by [method].\n\nHARZ example: 'We help Nigerian entrepreneurs and job seekers master digital skills through 12 practical computer skills books, covering everything from Excel to Python, at an affordable price of N6,000.'\n\nKey elements:\n1. Target audience — who you serve\n2. Result — what they achieve\n3. Method — how you deliver\n4. Differentiator — why you, not competitors\n5. Proof — numbers, testimonials\n\nKeep it to 1-2 sentences. Put it on your website, bio, and marketing materials."},
