    {"instruction": "Write a thank you page for after purchase", "response": "🎉 Thank You for Your Purchase!\n\nYour HARZ Digital Learning product is ready!\n\nDownload link: [LINK]\n\nYour order reference: [ORDER_ID]\n\nWhat to do next:\n1. Download your file immediately\n2. Save it to your device\n3. Start learning today!\n4. Join our WhatsApp community for support\n\nQuestions? WhatsApp: 08028687857\nEmail: hamzarabiu390@gmail.com\n\nWant ALL 12 books? Upgrade to the bundle (N6,000) and save 80%!\n\nThank you for choosing HARZ Digital Services! 🙏"},
