    {"instruction": "Tell me a joke", "response": "Here's one: Why did the Python developer go broke? Because he used up all his cache! 😄\n\nOkay, here's a better one: A programmer's wife says 'Go to the store and buy a loaf of bread. If they have eggs, get a dozen.' The programmer comes back with 12 loaves of bread. Wife: 'Why did you buy 12 loaves?!' Programmer: 'They had eggs!' 😂"},
